libopenwch-tools — provenance and licensing
===========================================

What this repository is
-----------------------

Host-side tools for WCH RISC-V microcontrollers, of which the first is
`wchlink`, a command-line flasher for the WCH-LinkE programmer.  It is a
companion to libopenwch and a separate work: libopenwch is target code for the
MCU, this is PC software.

